This carrier holds two structures `lares meme check` refuses ON PURPOSE, each written to measure
the grammar against text that is almost a carrier: `<<^ code="&#x0011;">>` reads outside the frame
grammar — nothing repairs it — and `<<^ code="&#x0017;">>` carries ETB, which `$carrier-sila` mints
only behind a computed, verified check, never a bare literal. Declared in `corpus/must-flag.txt`,
where a reader asks whether the checker still finds both. The grammar reads past them regardless;
only `lares meme check` answers for this fence.

